# Source: src/pipeline/diffusion_engine.h, src/pipeline/diffusion_engine.cpp
# Change: thread the VAE tile sink through StableDiffusionGGML::decode_first_stage, return an empty tensor when streaming succeeded, and skip the whole-video retry-tiling loop on the streaming path.
# Why:    The pipeline must be able to ask the VAE to stream and must not treat "no whole video tensor" as a failure nor decode a second time (that would duplicate frames).
